<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-10-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "i-Lab, Department of Cultural Technology and Communication, University of the Aegean" .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Trajecto POI Module"@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "poi" .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#" .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "trajecto-poi"@en .
