<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMaximumReasonableDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Maximum reasonable duration for interaction with this POI category before it becomes anomalous."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMaximumReasonableDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> .
