<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMaximumReasonableDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The upper threshold beyond which an interaction duration is considered unusually long."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMaximumReasonableDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration> .
