<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Minimum duration required for an interaction to be considered meaningful for this POI category."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has minimum meaningful duration"@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The threshold duration below which an interaction is considered too brief to be meaningful for the specific POI type."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration> .
