<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasTypicalDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has typical duration"@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasTypicalDuration> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The average or expected duration for normal engagement with this type of POI."@en .
