<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#WaterFountain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A water fountain. Not yet placed in the POI hierarchy and not linked to its own dwell configuration (WaterFountain-configuration); interactions with it use the default configuration."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#WaterFountain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#WaterFountain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Water Fountain"@en .
