<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#POITypeConfiguration> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMaximumReasonableDuration> "PT15M"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#hasMinimumMeaningfulDuration> "PT1M"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#duration> .
