<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dwell thresholds: an interaction is meaningful from 1 min, typical at 3 min, and anomalous beyond 15 min. Used by: ATM."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#ATM-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ATM configuration"@en .
