<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#AccommodationPOI-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dwell thresholds: an interaction is meaningful from 30 min, typical at 2 h, and anomalous beyond P1D. Used by: Accommodation."@en .
<http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi#AccommodationPOI-configuration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://w3id.org/trajecto/poi> .
